classDiagram
    %% Healix v0.3 增量设计（第三波 B2）— 类图
    %% 生成：2026-10-06 架构师（高见远）。修订：2026-10-06（BP-1…BP-6 裁定后）。
    %% 与 docs/v0.3-增量设计-W3-2026-10-06.md §3.1/§3.2 同源。
    %% 注：未覆盖 docs/class-diagram.mermaid 及 W1/W2 的 v0.3-增量-* 图。

    class Fragment
    class RecordFragment {
        -_binding FragmentRecordBinding
        -eventAdapter EventAdapter
        -headerAdapter RecordHeaderAdapter
        -emptyAdapter RecordEmptyAdapter
        -headerBinding ItemRecordHeaderBinding
        -concatAdapter ConcatAdapter
        -swipe SwipeController
        -HEADER_ITEM_COUNT = 1
        +onViewCreated()
        -observe()
        -renderGoalArea()
        -renderPrimaryRow()
        -renderCards()
        -renderGapRow()
        -renderPresetStrip()
        -deleteWithUndo()
    }
    Fragment <|-- RecordFragment

    class ConcatAdapter {
        +adapters List
        +itemCount
    }

    class RecordHeaderAdapter {
        -onHeaderBound
        +getItemCount() 1
        +onCreateViewHolder() VH
        +onBindViewHolder() Unit
    }
    class HeaderVH {
        +b ItemRecordHeaderBinding
    }
    class RecordEmptyAdapter {
        -empty Boolean
        +setEmpty(v Boolean)
        +getItemCount() Int
        +onCreateViewHolder() VH
        +onBindViewHolder() Unit
    }
    class EmptyVH {
        +b ItemRecordEmptyBinding
    }
    class EventAdapter {
        +hideKcal Boolean
        +submit(list)
    }
    class ItemRecordHeaderBinding {
        +goalArea
        +presetScroll
        +presetDivider
        +statusRow
        +nudgeBar
        +planBar
    }
    class ItemRecordEmptyBinding {
        +emptyHint
        +emptyExample
    }
    class FragmentRecordBinding {
        +topBar
        +offlineBar
        +undoBar
        +inputBar
    }

    RecordFragment --> ConcatAdapter : 装配（3 段）
    ConcatAdapter o-- RecordHeaderAdapter : 段 0
    ConcatAdapter o-- EventAdapter : 段 1（BP-3 零改动）
    ConcatAdapter o-- RecordEmptyAdapter : 段 2（BP-1 footer）
    RecordHeaderAdapter --> HeaderVH
    RecordHeaderAdapter --> ItemRecordHeaderBinding : inflate + 回传 onHeaderBound
    RecordEmptyAdapter --> EmptyVH
    RecordEmptyAdapter --> ItemRecordEmptyBinding : inflate
    RecordFragment ..> ItemRecordHeaderBinding : headerBinding 渲染目标
    RecordFragment --> EventAdapter : 偏移用 itemCount 子坐标
    RecordFragment ..> RecordEmptyAdapter : setEmpty(list.isEmpty())
    RecordFragment ..> FragmentRecordBinding : _binding 固定区

    class SwipeController {
        +onTouch(item, event)
        +closeIfOutside(hit)
        +closeAll()
        +clickAllowed()
    }
    class UndoBar {
        +bind(container, left, action, text, announce, onUndo)
        +DURATION_MS = 5000
    }
    class InputBarHeightAnimator {
        +bind(input, bar, onGrow)
    }

    RecordFragment --> SwipeController : binding.list 监听器（零改动）
    RecordFragment ..> UndoBar : undoBar 固定元素 不进 RecyclerView
    RecordFragment ..> InputBarHeightAnimator : onGrow 加 HEADER_ITEM_COUNT 偏移
    EventAdapter ..> SwipeController : 每行 swipeItem.onTouch

    note for RecordHeaderAdapter "new：承载 item_record_header.xml；首绑回传 binding"
    note for RecordEmptyAdapter "new：仅事件为空时占 1 项；承载 item_record_empty.xml"
    note for EventAdapter "unchanged：ConcatAdapter 直接包裹"
    note for ItemRecordHeaderBinding "滚动区 6 段（BP-2 收窄）"
    note for FragmentRecordBinding "固定区 顶栏 + offlineBar + undoBar + inputBar"
